{"schemaVersion":4,"creatorIndex":5,"creatorName":"Gergely Orosz","creatorHandle":"GergelyOrosz","lane":"Software engineering","phase1Followers":352392,"authorHandle":"GergelyOrosz","authorUserId":"30192824","authorName":"Gergely Orosz","authorFollowersObserved":352632,"authorFollowingObserved":3064,"authorPostsObserved":47133,"collectionSource":"browser_graphql_user_replies_timeline_v4","observedAt":"2026-09-03T20:16:18.045Z","id":"2095507004223586681","postType":"reply","text":"Your mistake was engaging\n\nI have given up on journalists, waste of time and effort \n\nAlso why, when people ask me if I’m a journalist, my answer is NO\n\nI send my full draft to the person I quote to make sure it’s not out of context or mistaken (and have them correct if so). Apparently this goes against “journalistic integrity” in return I’m 100% correct\n\nAlso, I did the work I write about and try to do it still\n\nTraditional tech media is dying and it’s clear enough from these pieces why","textSource":"note_tweet","textLength":492,"textPossiblyClipped":false,"timestampMs":1788442777000,"postedAt":"2026-09-03T13:39:37.000Z","postAgeHoursAtObservation":6.611401388888889,"url":"https://x.com/GergelyOrosz/status/2095507004223586681","views":4075,"likes":111,"reposts":0,"replies":2,"bookmarks":4,"quotes":0,"metricAvailability":{"views":true,"likes":true,"reposts":true,"replies":true,"bookmarks":true,"quotes":true},"hashtags":[],"mentions":["max_spero_"],"urls":[],"media":[],"photoCount":0,"videoCount":0,"quotedStatusId":null,"quotedPost":null,"inReplyToStatusId":"2095367528466018485","inReplyToUserId":"1618116703996502016","inReplyToUsername":"max_spero_","conversationId":"2095367528466018485","repostedPost":null,"sensitiveContent":false,"recentOrdinal":9}
